WEBVTT

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.840
After a fierce battle with 
the Shadow Ruffian Alliance,

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:07.760
Ise Shinkuro finally 
defeats the Four Kings!

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:11.740
But that was only the 
beginning of the battle.

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:14.450
The Shadow Ruffian Alliance Chairman

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:19.410
summoned the Shadow Eight 
Generals to eliminate her!

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:23.710
Ise Shinkuro battles the 
Shadow Eight Generals.

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:28.910
But in her battle with the Four 
Kings, she hurt her good hand,

00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:32.650
and lost her blade, Nikko Ichimonji.

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:35.440
Where are you going when you're 
that badly hurt, Shinku?

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:37.770
I'm going to the battlefield!

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:40.310
That was decided long ago!

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.430
A wounded Ise Shinkuro continues her battle.

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:47.710
Shinku, come back!

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:50.260
Who will be the winner?

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:53.240
Pretty sure that isn't what happened.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.850
Yeah?

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:56.030
Unfortunate.

00:02:31.610 --> 00:02:33.340
Do you always eat that much?

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:37.780
No. I'm just a little hungry after 
my first exercise in a while.

00:02:37.780 --> 00:02:39.890
You haven't eaten lately.

00:02:39.890 --> 00:02:43.300
Yes. Very sorry about that.

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:47.020
But eating that much 
at once isn't healthy.

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:48.970
I'm fine.

00:02:48.970 --> 00:02:51.980
What about you, Jun? 
Is that all you want to eat?

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:54.620
You had gym class, too.

00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:57.260
One bowl of udon noodles 
doesn't seem like much.

00:02:57.260 --> 00:02:59.140
I don't eat much.

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:00.490
Okay, then.

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:03.280
Now that you mention it, 
the Shadow Ruffian Alliance!

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:04.420
I didn't mention it.

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:07.980
I skipped fourth period 
to investigate...

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:10.410
Don't skip class.

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:11.840
I don't have a choice.

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:14.630
The battle has begun.

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:17.110
You're the one who started it, aren't you?

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:19.050
Yes, I was.

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:20.750
Umm...

00:03:21.390 --> 00:03:23.030
May I continue?

00:03:23.030 --> 00:03:23.930
Yeah.

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:26.350
I did some investigating,

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:28.250
and the Shadow Ruffian 
Alliance is amazing.

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:30.350
They've hidden themselves so well,

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:32.710
you would think they're actually shadows.

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:35.730
They're a worthy rival!

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:37.980
I'm all fired up!

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:40.220
I-Is that so...

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:43.320
<i>I came up with that lie 
to make her happy...</i>

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:45.990
<i>Should I tell her the truth?</i>

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:48.990
I was considering seppuku when I

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:51.140
defeated the ruffians so easily,

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:53.320
but now I can't possibly die until

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:54.910
I've defeated the Shadow 
Ruffian Alliance!

00:03:54.910 --> 00:03:55.960
Seppuku?

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:58.360
And you're going to die 
when you defeat them?

00:03:58.360 --> 00:04:00.270
Eh, it's just an expression.

00:04:00.270 --> 00:04:03.010
Don't scare me like that, Shinku.

00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:06.760
<i>On second thought, 
maybe I shouldn't tell her.</i>

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:10.620
Anyway, Shinku, hypothetically,

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:12.100
and I'm just speaking 
hypothetically here,

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:14.480
if you found the Shadow 
Ruffian Alliance,

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:16.220
what would you do with them?

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:18.400
Destroy them all, of course!

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:20.000
Obliterate them!

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:21.720
Thought so.

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:23.900
They're smart, the Shadow 
Ruffian Alliance.

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:26.130
Now that I've defeated their ruffians,

00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:29.390
they'll be on the lookout for me.

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:35.310
I know you're strong, 
but can I say something?

00:04:35.310 --> 00:04:36.710
What?

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:38.600
No matter how strong you are,

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:41.590
I think it's dangerous 
to make enemies out of

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:43.050
somebody called an "alliance."

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:48.600
That's why I'm going to find 
them and destroy them!

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:49.810
Really?

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:53.050
If they're going to be 
after me 24 hours a day,

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:55.060
even I'd feel in danger.

00:04:55.620 --> 00:04:59.240
Is there anything more 
dangerous than having

00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:01.550
them come after you while 
you don't do anything?

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:03.850
Come to think of it, 
you're right, but...

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:10.830
Why are you so confident?

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:14.870
I am a Warring States General 
guarded by the flame.

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:18.320
I don't think I'd lose to 
anybody in this world.

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:19.690
Guarded by the flame?

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:20.790
Yes.

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:22.340
It was...

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:26.630
When I was small.

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:30.350
I went to the mountains to pick herbs.

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:37.390
It was a beautiful day, 
and the flowers were so pretty.

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:40.750
And then...

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:48.530
A volcano suddenly erupted!

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:55.540
I felt like something was calling me,

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:57.850
so I went to the summit.

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:00.350
And there...

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:15.520
Falling into the lava would 
normally kill you, wouldn't it?

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:19.830
It was then that I realized 
that heat can't hurt me.

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:22.210
Is that the issue?

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:23.400
It is.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:25.860
That was a good meal.

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:29.110
I'll continue my investigations 
this afternoon.

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:30.860
What about class?

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:32.580
As I said earlier,

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:34.880
if I don't find and destroy 
the Shadow Ruffian Alliance soon,

00:06:34.880 --> 00:06:36.950
I'll be too worried to sleep at night.

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:39.400
Oh, right.

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:53.560
A weak force called the van-der-waals

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:55.690
<i>I'm glad Shinku's feeling better,
but at this rate</i>

00:06:53.560 --> 00:06:55.700
force that works on molecules...

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:58.760
<i>there is no point in taking her to school.</i>

00:06:56.850 --> 00:07:00.890
There are other types of bonding known 
as covalent and ionic bonding...

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:02.560
Hey, Takahashi.

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:04.100
Pay attention.

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:06.150
S-Sorry!

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:10.900
Shinku isn't back.

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:14.100
Did she go home on her own?

00:07:15.630 --> 00:07:18.160
Oh, good, you're still here, Jun.

00:07:18.860 --> 00:07:21.040
Shinku, are you okay?

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:22.640
Yes, of course.

00:07:22.640 --> 00:07:25.530
But I guess I kept you waiting...

00:07:25.530 --> 00:07:27.470
No, I'm fine.

00:07:27.470 --> 00:07:30.260
Anyway, the Shadow Ruffian 
Alliance continues

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:31.090
to amaze me.

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:32.910
You didn't find them, did you?

00:07:32.910 --> 00:07:36.300
No. No leads yet.

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:39.370
The ruffians claim they 
don't know anything.

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:43.090
They must've been 
terrified into silence.

00:07:43.090 --> 00:07:45.360
I'm pretty sure that's 
what they'd say, yeah.

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:47.250
The Shadow Ruffian Alliance

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:51.730
must have the ability to plant 
small bombs in someone's body.

00:07:51.730 --> 00:07:52.440
What?

00:07:52.440 --> 00:07:53.410
Yes.

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:58.040
Let slip even a single 
word and you'll explode.

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:00.660
They aren't that scary!

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:04.110
Otherwise, I don't understand why

00:08:04.110 --> 00:08:07.110
they would be willing to risk 
my blade to avoid talking.

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:09.650
Maybe they don't know?

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:11.670
Where are they?

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:14.790
<i>I feel bad for tricking her,</i>

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:17.430
<i>but maybe this is for the 
best until she finds</i>

00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:20.040
<i>something new to do...</i>

00:08:21.240 --> 00:08:22.430
Is something wrong?

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:24.590
No, nothing.

00:08:24.590 --> 00:08:26.400
All right, then.

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:27.600
Let's go home.

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:28.440
Yeah.

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:32.080
I don't think I'll find 
anything else today.

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:33.700
Yeah.

00:08:46.970 --> 00:08:48.920
The Shadow Ruffian Alliance.

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:54.720
Are you another general?

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:56.260
That's right.

00:08:56.850 --> 00:08:59.980
Did you think you were the only one?

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:03.790
My name is Kazama Kotaro.

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:06.100
And what people call me is... a secret!

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:07.990
I don't understand why you would

00:09:07.990 --> 00:09:10.360
give your name but keep what 
people call you a secret!

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:14.160
If you really want to know,
 I'll tell you.

00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:16.050
No, I'm not interested at all.

00:09:16.050 --> 00:09:18.410
So you don't have to tell me.

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:19.760
You're just saying that.

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:21.560
You really want to know, don't you?

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:25.120
If it's a secret, then feel 
free to take it to your grave.

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:28.250
If you don't hear it now, 
you're going to regret it!

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:29.260
I'll be fine.

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:31.980
Y-You'll truly regret it!

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:33.510
I'm prepared to face the consequences.

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:35.980
I-If you don't ask what 
it is, you'll die!

00:09:35.980 --> 00:09:37.790
That'll be your fate!

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:40.430
Then I shall overcome that fate!

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:43.690
Shinku, I feel bad. Ask her what she's called.

00:09:43.690 --> 00:09:45.540
If she wants to hide it,

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:47.350
I can't understand why I would ask.

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:49.190
She wants to say it!

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:51.780
I guarantee you she wants to say it!

00:09:51.780 --> 00:09:53.030
I see.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:56.740
Then tell me what people call you!

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:59.590
If you absolutely insist, I'll tell you.

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:01.910
My name is Fuuma Kotaro!

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:03.240
An Ashigara ninja!

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:05.780
I am Ise Shinkuro!

00:10:05.780 --> 00:10:06.660
Here I go!

00:10:12.180 --> 00:10:14.900
Is this really okay?!

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:30.940
You impress me, assassin of the
Shadow Ruffian Alliance!

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:34.690
It makes me mad that you
laugh as you say that!

00:10:40.470 --> 00:10:43.660
You're quite talented, 
but a true ninja

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:46.200
would've tried to 
avoid a frontal attack.

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:48.830
I'm not done yet.

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:51.830
As the head of the Fuuma 
clan, I cannot lose!

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:58.610
The minute you decided 
to fight on even ground

00:10:58.610 --> 00:11:01.420
with a samurai, 
you never had a chance.

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:04.740
And I consider myself one

00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:09.000
of the better fighters among the samurai.

00:11:10.010 --> 00:11:13.270
It looks like you are 
a pretty good fighter.

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:15.440
But that's all.

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:19.320
You'll never be as big 
a person as they are!

00:11:19.810 --> 00:11:24.330
Is "they" the chairman of the 
Shadow Ruffian Alliance?

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:26.610
That's a secret...

00:11:26.610 --> 00:11:27.720
Okay.

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:29.040
Then I won't ask.

00:11:30.050 --> 00:11:32.480
I won't ask, so don't worry.

00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:34.540
Of course, I won't torture 
you or anything.

00:11:35.140 --> 00:11:37.860
You think maybe you should ask?

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:39.760
She really wants to tell you.

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:41.900
No, absolutely not.

00:11:41.900 --> 00:11:44.510
Honestly, I regret asking earlier.

00:11:44.510 --> 00:11:47.560
Fuuma's a stupid name.

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:50.000
Seriously?

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:51.490
If you don't want to know,

00:11:51.490 --> 00:11:53.440
then I won't tell you 
their secret identity.

00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:57.210
If you're not scared 
of them, go to the gym.

00:11:57.210 --> 00:11:59.760
You can be surprised when 
you meet them there!

00:12:02.710 --> 00:12:05.120
Shinku, this is a bad idea.

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:06.200
Why?

00:12:06.610 --> 00:12:08.430
Because it's scary!

00:12:08.430 --> 00:12:10.630
The Shadow Ruffian 
Alliance really exists,

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:12.440
and their chairman is waiting for you!

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:14.210
True, it's scary.

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:17.160
They may be incredibly powerful,

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:20.210
and they may have a trap waiting!

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:21.830
A trap?

00:12:21.830 --> 00:12:22.910
Then...

00:12:22.910 --> 00:12:23.910
No, I'm going!

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:25.410
A powerful enemy and a trap!

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:27.250
I'm all fired up!

00:12:27.250 --> 00:12:28.720
O-Oh...

00:12:29.110 --> 00:12:33.520
<i>Stopping you would just get 
you more fired up, Shinku...</i>

00:12:34.630 --> 00:12:36.140
Hey, Shinku.

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:37.480
What?

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:41.100
I won't tell you to stop fighting,

00:12:41.100 --> 00:12:43.060
but promise me something.

00:12:43.060 --> 00:12:45.250
If it's something I can do.

00:12:45.670 --> 00:12:49.740
Even if there's a greater enemy 
waiting behind the chairman,

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:52.450
you'll go home with me.

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:53.780
I see!

00:12:53.780 --> 00:12:57.330
Come to think of it, the chairman 
might not be the boss!

00:12:57.330 --> 00:13:00.220
Shinku, I'm serious.

00:13:00.220 --> 00:13:01.300
All right.

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:02.420
I promise.

00:13:02.980 --> 00:13:07.590
As soon as I defeat the chairman, 
I'll go back home with you.

00:13:08.950 --> 00:13:10.180
It's a promise!

00:13:10.780 --> 00:13:11.750
Yes.

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:13.510
Let's go back together.

00:13:13.510 --> 00:13:16.440
I always keep my promises.

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:23.110
Hello!

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:29.450
Oh, you're here already?

00:13:42.740 --> 00:13:43.670
Big!

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:47.510
She's a really big person!

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:50.180
I didn't know any of the other 
generals were this big!

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:53.740
She's just big in a 
literal sense, right?

00:13:53.740 --> 00:13:57.110
You can't judge a book 
by its cover, Jun.

00:13:57.110 --> 00:13:59.430
Are you going to tell me that?

00:13:59.430 --> 00:14:01.860
You're the one who said "big!"

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:04.760
And I don't think they're human!

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:07.860
I didn't expect you to 
make it here unharmed.

00:14:08.370 --> 00:14:10.100
Hojo Soun.

00:14:10.100 --> 00:14:13.210
You're as deadly a 
warrior as I've heard.

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:16.220
No. I abandoned the name Soun.

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:17.380
When I came to this world

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:19.410
and no longer had a master to serve,

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:21.200
I was no longer worthy of it.

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:23.800
But if you know that name...

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:25.810
Then who are you?

00:14:26.500 --> 00:14:29.780
The woman who's going to defeat 
you and make you join her.

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:32.810
Then I'll tell you something.

00:14:33.320 --> 00:14:36.390
I'm much more powerful 
than the rumors say!

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:41.430
How dare you speak like 
that in my presence!

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:44.410
Shinku!

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:46.780
Don't worry about me.

00:14:47.310 --> 00:14:51.680
But I don't think I can protect you.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:55.780
Don't worry.

00:14:55.780 --> 00:14:57.640
I'm not going to attack anyone but you,

00:14:57.640 --> 00:14:59.370
or take any hostages.

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:01.960
Glad to hear it.

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:06.170
I just don't need to!

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:22.070
Hojo Soun.

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:24.760
You aren't as powerful 
as the rumors said.

00:15:24.760 --> 00:15:26.230
I told you,

00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:30.890
I'm not Hojo Soun anymore.

00:15:30.890 --> 00:15:34.910
I have the nickname Jun gave me, Shinku.

00:15:35.310 --> 00:15:38.560
If you're going to call me 
something, call me Shinku.

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:40.500
I'm rather fond of it.

00:15:43.220 --> 00:15:47.030
Have you accepted defeat and are
now abandoning the fight, Soun?

00:15:47.030 --> 00:15:48.910
You really don't understand, do you?

00:15:48.910 --> 00:15:50.810
I am Ise Shinkuro.

00:15:50.810 --> 00:15:52.220
My nickname is Shinku.

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:55.970
If you call me Hojo Soun again, I'll get mad.

00:15:56.560 --> 00:16:00.980
Can you do something if 
you get mad? Hojo Soun.

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:05.350
Then I'm free to do it if I can, right?

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:10.210
Secret Technique: Cursed Combustion!

00:16:13.090 --> 00:16:15.410
<i>Her spiritual energy 
turned into flame...</i>

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:20.860
I am guarded by the flame, 
and it can't hurt me.

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:23.250
But can you survive this?

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:27.070
The gym's on fire, Shinku!

00:16:27.070 --> 00:16:29.870
Sacrifices must be made for victory!

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:33.510
But don't burn down my school!

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:35.970
I'm not scared of fire,

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:40.030
but I cannot lose this school, either!

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:50.530
You can control flame, 
but I control water!

00:16:50.830 --> 00:16:52.580
As long as this rain falls,

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:55.490
you can't use your Cursed Combustion!

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:57.860
Fire and water...

00:16:57.860 --> 00:16:59.870
I'm at a disadvantage, but...

00:17:00.480 --> 00:17:02.940
Even so, I won't lose to you.

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:14.050
So she's controlling a 
huge puppet with water?

00:17:14.350 --> 00:17:16.460
I'll praise you for seeing 
through my trick.

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:18.030
But...

00:17:20.210 --> 00:17:21.310
I see.

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:25.380
So a little damage won't be enough.

00:17:25.380 --> 00:17:27.570
I was planning on holding back,

00:17:27.570 --> 00:17:29.110
but this is a battle!

00:17:29.590 --> 00:17:32.080
Don't hate me if you die.

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:38.490
You were holding back?

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:42.330
If nothing else, I was 
planning on not killing you.

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:45.830
Hojo Soun bluffing?

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:49.080
I never heard any rumors about that!

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:51.880
I'm sure you didn't.

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:54.760
It's just the truth!

00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:05.950
Is that all you've got, Hojo Soun?

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:08.610
I told you.

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:11.770
I'm much more powerful 
than the rumors say!

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:43.590
I guess you're alive.

00:18:44.070 --> 00:18:46.210
I thought that if you were from the

00:18:46.210 --> 00:18:49.140
same world I was, you'd 
probably be okay, but...

00:18:49.380 --> 00:18:52.680
You were still holding 
back after all that?

00:18:52.680 --> 00:18:54.460
My goal was to

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:59.110
save the school from the 
Shadow Ruffian Alliance.

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:02.240
Not make enemies.

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:07.770
And so here's a question: 
will you still fight me?

00:19:08.350 --> 00:19:10.000
If I say yes?

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:13.140
I would keep fighting.

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:23.010
Stand down, Hojo Soun.

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:27.040
Is that you, Sessai-dono?

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:30.490
Yes. It's been a long time, Soun.

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:33.730
It truly has, Sessai-dono.

00:19:35.470 --> 00:19:36.990
Are you okay?

00:19:36.990 --> 00:19:38.190
Yes.

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:41.450
Soun, you know who this 
is now, don't you?

00:19:41.890 --> 00:19:43.130
Yes.

00:19:43.130 --> 00:19:46.200
I've never personally been 
introduced to her, but...

00:19:46.480 --> 00:19:49.040
The head of the Imagawa clan.

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:50.710
Imagawa Yoshimoto-sama.

00:19:51.190 --> 00:19:53.100
So you're Yoshimoto-sama.

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:56.780
You were so big, I didn't notice.

00:19:57.480 --> 00:19:59.580
I apologize.

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:01.650
I don't mind.

00:20:01.650 --> 00:20:04.500
It was my fault for trying to test you.

00:20:04.960 --> 00:20:06.510
Test me?

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:09.580
I want to ask your help, 
as another of the

00:20:09.580 --> 00:20:11.730
Imagawa forces who's come to this world.

00:20:12.340 --> 00:20:13.910
Help?

00:20:13.910 --> 00:20:15.740
With Oda Nobunaga.

00:20:15.740 --> 00:20:18.290
I've heard the name.

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:20.150
I guess they're in this world, too.

00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:24.590
I want to get even with 
Nobunaga, no matter what.

00:20:25.080 --> 00:20:27.490
And I need your power for that.

00:20:28.760 --> 00:20:30.610
I don't really understand,

00:20:30.610 --> 00:20:33.280
but the Imagawas were good to me once.

00:20:33.910 --> 00:20:38.690
I would never refuse the request 
of their current leader.

00:20:38.690 --> 00:20:39.570
I see.

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:41.170
I'm happy to hear that, Soun.

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:45.260
Excuse me. 
It's Ise Shinkuro now, isn't it?

00:20:45.730 --> 00:20:48.720
No, Soun is fine.

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:51.770
If I'm going to serve 
the Imagawa once again,

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:55.230
I shall be Hojo Soun once more.

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:56.270
Shinku!

00:20:59.730 --> 00:21:02.030
You promised you'd go home with me!

00:21:02.540 --> 00:21:03.560
Jun!

00:21:03.560 --> 00:21:05.940
And now you're going back 
to being Hojo Soun?

00:21:06.420 --> 00:21:08.280
That's not fair!

00:21:10.590 --> 00:21:12.780
I like the name Shinku.

00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:17.150
And I'll never forget the 
kindness of the Takahashi clan.

00:21:17.150 --> 00:21:18.170
Then...

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:21.420
But my promise to serve the Imagawas

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:23.630
was made before I met you.

00:21:24.210 --> 00:21:26.680
I must fulfill it.

00:21:27.110 --> 00:21:29.800
I keep the promises I make.

00:21:31.170 --> 00:21:34.440
Then what about the promise 
you made with me?

00:21:34.970 --> 00:21:37.090
It may take a while.

00:21:37.090 --> 00:21:38.660
But someday, I'll return.

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:41.480
I promise that again.

00:21:42.130 --> 00:21:44.710
But now I am Hojo Soun,

00:21:44.710 --> 00:21:46.290
a servant of the Imagawa clan.

00:21:46.840 --> 00:21:52.360
So I'll keep that promise 
when I can visit you again.

00:21:52.360 --> 00:21:55.460
So we can go back together then, right?

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:56.850
Yes.

00:21:56.850 --> 00:21:58.520
When that happens, Jun,

00:21:58.520 --> 00:22:01.250
please call me Shinku again.

00:22:02.410 --> 00:22:04.970
Okay! It's a promise!

00:22:04.970 --> 00:22:07.470
Let me call you Shinku again, okay?

00:22:07.860 --> 00:22:10.540
Yes. Please do!

00:23:45.810 --> 00:23:47.780
Next time it's the brutal maiden,

00:23:47.780 --> 00:23:49.860
Matsunaga Misahide!

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:53.620
Next time on Sengoku 
Collection: "Brutal Maiden."

00:23:53.620 --> 00:23:56.450
I'm fired up for no reason!
